<title>USA: McKinney, Texas, $1.91 mln won by First Tennessee. [CORRECTED 23:17 GMT]</title>
<headline>McKinney, Texas, $1.91 mln won by First Tennessee. [CORRECTED 23:17 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
